---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";

const phone = "070-1666-0987";
---

<section class="scallop-top scallop-bottom bg-blush-soft px-6 py-16">
  <SectionTitle en="Contact" ja="当日のお問い合わせ" />

  <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-sm text-center">
    <p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-wider text-ink">
      道に迷われた場合など、当日ご連絡が<br />必要なときはこちらへお電話ください。
    </p>
    <a
      href={`tel:${phone}`}
      class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-deep-red px-7 py-3 text-ivory transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-deep-red"
    >
      <svg
        class="h-4 w-4"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.6"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          d="M5 4h3.5l1.6 4.2-2.2 1.4a11 11 0 0 0 6.5 6.5l1.4-2.2L20 15.5V19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.6 1.5A16 16 0 0 1 3.5 5.6 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5 4z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="font-roman lining-nums text-xl font-medium tracking-[0.08em]">{phone}</span>
    </a>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs tracking-wider text-rose-taupe">佐竹友真</p>
  </div>
</section>
